  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n- New `ProcessControlAdapter` abstraction (`BaseProcessControlAdapter`, `WindowsProcessControlAdapter`, `UnixProcessControlAdapter`) to decouple OS-specific process control logic (suspend, resume, resource policy) from `ProcessWrapper`\n- `ProcessControlAdapterFactory` for platform-specific adapter creation\n- `src/global.json` pinning .NET SDK 10.0.0 with `latestMajor` roll-forward and prerelease support\n- Re-enabled `Polyfill` NuGet package reference (was previously commented out)\n\n### Changed\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 10.7.0 to 10.10.0\n* Updated DotExtensions version from 10.3.2 to 10.3.3\n- **Architecture rework**: `ProcessInvoker` and `CliRun` now delegate to `IExternalProcess` via `IExternalProcessFactory` instead of directly constructing and managing `ProcessWrapper` instances\n- `ProcessWrapper` moved from `CliInvoke.Helpers` to `CliInvoke.Processes.Internal` namespace\n- Process cancellation and piping code consolidated into the internal `ProcessWrapper`\n- Cancellation helpers (`CancellationHelper`, `CancellationReason`) moved to `CliInvoke.Processes.Internal.Cancellation`\n- `ExternalProcess.CaptureBufferedResultAsync` reworked to use `ProcessWrapper.ReadAllTextAsync` instead of separate `StandardOutput.ReadToEndAsync` / `StandardError.ReadToEndAsync` calls\n- Enabled `GenerateDocumentationFile` globally in `Directory.Build.props`\n- `ArgumentsBuilder`: replaced `var` with explicit `List<string>` / `List<IFormattable>` types for clarity\n- Fixed trailing semicolon in `TargetFrameworks` (`net10.0;net8.0;net9.0;` → `net10.0;net8.0;net9.0`)\n\n### Fixed\n- **Process exit semaphore leak on Unix systems** — the cancellation semaphore was not being released in all exit paths\n- Buffered output reading race condition in `ExternalProcess` by consolidating stdout/stderr reads into a single `ReadAllTextAsync` call\n\n### Removed\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.ProcessWrapper` (replaced by `CliInvoke.Processes.Internal.ProcessWrapper`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.ProcessCancellationExtensions` (consolidated into internal `ProcessWrapper`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.ProcessPipingHelper` (consolidated into internal `ProcessWrapper`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.ToStartInfoExtensions` (moved to internal usage)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.ApplyInfos.ApplyConfigurationToProcessStartInfo` (moved to `ProcessControlAdapters`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.ApplyInfos.ProcessSetPolicyExtensions` (moved to `ProcessControlAdapters`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.Cancellation.UnixGracefulCancellation` (consolidated into `UnixProcessControlAdapter`)\n- `CliInvoke.Helpers.Processes.Cancellation.WindowsGracefulCancellation` (consolidated into `WindowsProcessControlAdapter`)",
